                        "form": "cryolipolyses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e146477f-e555-3c47-83ea-af5c252b675e",
                        "entry_id": "c79bf3a9-fe72-3d34-b325-89bbb1c6b732",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Technique externe de destruction des cellules graisseuses par le froid."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8558a476-c401-489e-b1e1-eac4411995a8",
                                "sense_id": "e146477f-e555-3c47-83ea-af5c252b675e",
                                "text": "La cryolipolyse est une technique récente en plein essor qui permet de traiter les excès graisseux au cours d’une séance au cabinet du chirurgien, sans anesthésie, sans pansement et sans hospitalisation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d28dac71-ef57-47c6-a9bd-d7c9e2c43257",
                                "sense_id": "e146477f-e555-3c47-83ea-af5c252b675e",
                                "text": "La Haute Autorité de santé, qui a mené cette évaluation, conclut que « la pratique des actes de cryolipolyse présente une suspicion de danger grave pour la santé humaine » et préconise un encadrement des appareils et des professionnels."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a6c03fb0-d9d7-4de6-9aa8-a0d84617560d",
                        "source_entry_id": "c79bf3a9-fe72-3d34-b325-89bbb1c6b732",
                        "source_sense_id": "e146477f-e555-3c47-83ea-af5c252b675e",
                        "target_lang_word": "Kryolipolyse",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0c4bfd63-6c37-439d-848e-436ec4306750",
                        "source_entry_id": "c79bf3a9-fe72-3d34-b325-89bbb1c6b732",
                        "source_sense_id": "e146477f-e555-3c47-83ea-af5c252b675e",
                        "target_lang_word": "cryolipolysis",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cryolipolysis",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c0a4cca-5855-3078-8b68-52dddf8ee1d0",
                                        "entry_id": "d21c912b-1dea-31e5-a17c-c04b5b42e426",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A noninvasive technique for removing fat through subcutaneous application of cold."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f737f0e-be50-493c-abd8-612bda15d218",
                                                "sense_id": "0c0a4cca-5855-3078-8b68-52dddf8ee1d0",
                                                "text": "Physicians should discuss the possibility of temporary altered sensation with their patients before undergoing cryolipolysis, and reiterate that while this effect may occur, it is transient and will require no treatment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "372eb043-6033-4d40-ab25-d6a6513092d3",
                                                "sense_id": "0c0a4cca-5855-3078-8b68-52dddf8ee1d0",
                                                "text": "Although cryolipolysis is a promising new technology, it is important to bear in mind a few potential limitations. In the human clinical studies, results were most visible in patients with discrete, localized fat bulges. Cryolipolysis does not appear to be as effective in obese patients or patients with excess skin laxity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "118ea634-f697-47f5-b053-b8b32b84eba6",
                                                "sense_id": "0c0a4cca-5855-3078-8b68-52dddf8ee1d0",
                                                "text": "These areas remain the focus of most noninvasive body contouring technologies including cryolipolysis, nonthermal focused ultrasound, high-intensity thermal focused ultrasound (HIFU), and focus field radiofrequency."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
